<title>LATVIA: SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT LATVIA 3-1 IN WORD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT LATVIA 3-1 IN WORD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria beat Latvia 3-1 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) in their World Cup European group four qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Latvia - Vitali Astafjev 87</p>
<p>Austria - Andreas Heraf 55, Anton Polster 81, Peter Stoger</p>
<p>85</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
</text>
